 "notModeled": [
  "analog input, reference, LDO (INTLDO, LVDD), REXT power scaling (LP vs VLP); INTLDO is listed in analog because it is strapped to AVDD",
  "conversion time keyed only on OSR[1:0] for the HR mode wideband filters at fCLK = 16.384 MHz (Table 1: 512, 256, 128, 64 kSPS): the low-latency filter (FILTER = 10: OSR 32/128/512/2048, Table 2) and the LP/VLP clock rates (8.192 / 4.096 MHz) are not reflected, because the time can be chosen by two fields only; filter settling after START/reset (84 tDATA wideband, Table 3 low-latency) not modeled; the CLK pin is not used",
  "only the SPI interface (FORMAT = 0) is modeled; frame-sync master/slave modes (FSMODE, DRDY/FSYNC and SCLK as outputs) are not",
  "status word fixed at its power-on setting after the 24 data bits: CRC-4 of the 0 V data (0000), INP 0, 000 = 00h; with CRCB = 1 the CRC-8 of zero data is also 00h; CONFIG.CS_ENB = 1 (status word off) is not reflected (the extra 8 bits read 0 either way)",
  "conversions stop and restart: a START command is needed with the START pin low; START pin rising edge or START command restarts (filter reset); a change on a mode pin after power-up resets the device (not modeled)",
  "RESET/PWDN: low < 2^15 - 1 tCLK resets, longer powers down (modeled as reset held); reset/power-down exit timing",
  "DRDY returns high on the first SCLK falling edge (modeled: cleared by reading the data) and pulses high 2 tCLK before the next data when not read; keep-out time tKO",
  "daisy-chain via DAISYIN (DOUT after the data shows DAISYIN data); SPI timeout (CONFIG.SPI_TOUT, TOUT_DEL)",
  "offset/gain calibration math (OFC, FSC registers stored only)",
  "ID REV_ID bits (undefined) modeled 0"
